# Tamagi — GPU, compute & media drivers offered at first login (tamagi-welcome / tamagi-firstrun).
# Open-source Mesa + Vulkan (32/64-bit) for AMD & Intel already ship in the base image.
#   <on|off> <id>   id from catalog.tsv
off video-nvidia
off nvidia-cuda
off video-amd
off rocm
off video-intel
off intel-compute
off codecs-extra
off lact
off vulkan-tools
